  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What is the difference between an HRMS and an ATS?",
      "a": "<p>An HRMS manages staff you already have. An ATS manages job posts and candidates before they join.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Does a small business need HR software?",
      "a": "<p>As a team grows, manual payroll, leave and hiring work grows fast. So software usually pays off well before you need an HR department.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Does Openink Hub offer HR software?",
      "a": "<p>Yes. See our <a href=\"/human-resources-management/\">HRMS</a> and <a href=\"/application-tracking-system/\">applicant tracking system</a>.</p>"
